summary:
Company’s First Ground-Up, Dual Distribution Center Represents Economic Investment in Washington County;

Local Donation Further Illustrates Commitment to Serve the Community

BLAIR, Neb., August 19, 2023--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Today, Dollar General celebrated the grand opening of its Blair, Nebraska distribution center with employees and their families and elected officials, which included a donation to Washington County Food Pantry at Joseph’s Coat to demonstrate the Company’s commitment to the loc
